<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-overline">Make and understand</div>
  <h1 class="hero-title">Learn</h1>
  <p class="hero-lede">Two ways in. If you have a map to make, start on the left — each how-to is one task, done in minutes. If you want to know why maps look the way they do, start on the right.</p>
